  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Original Tempskya-inspired cut composite false-trunk specimen only: unequal rounded/lobed small stem islands are embedded in a dense root matrix, with interwoven cable-like root bands across the cut and outer side. Filled stem sections are larger than root strands, not concentric ordinary wood rings or punched holes. Nominal38cm, organ counts, cut relief and color are artistic; no living crown, leaves or whole fern inferred.",
    "zh": "原创Tempskya启发切面复合假干标本：不等大圆/浅裂小茎岛包埋于密集根基质，切面与外侧有交织绳状根带，实心茎切面大于细根而非普通木纹同心圆孔。名义38厘米、数量裁面起伏与配色属美术，不推全株冠叶。"
  },
